:"center","title_color":"#1a1a1a","color":"#1a1a1a","remove_padding_top":true,"remove_padding_bottom":true}},"faq_GNWdwG":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_tHmYAM":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"<strong>What is the difference between Influencer Marketing and Creator Affiliate Marketing?<\/strong>","answer":"<p><strong>Influencer Marketing<\/strong> focuses on <strong>brand awareness<\/strong> and <strong>engagement<\/strong>. It leverages individuals with strong online influence to create content that resonates with their audience, aiming to build long-term trust and brand visibility. The content is often creative and narrative-driven, emphasizing the brand's values and story.<\/p><p><strong>Affiliate Marketing<\/strong>, on the other hand, is centered on <strong>driving sales<\/strong> and <strong>traffic<\/strong>. Affiliates promote products through tracked links, earning commissions \/ fixed fee + commissions based on actual sales or clicks. This strategy is more transactional, with a clear focus on measurable results like conversions.<\/p>","icon":"none","icon_width":24,"mobile_icon_width":20}},"question_V9agg3":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"<strong>How do I choose between Influencer Creative or Studio-produced creative ?<\/strong>","answer":"<p><strong>Influencer Native Creatives<\/strong><br\/>On social media like Meta and TikTok, influencer-created content delivers naturality and authenticity, building trust and connection with the audience, showcasing real product experiences and strengthens brand credibility.<br\/><br\/><strong>Studio-produced Creatives<\/strong><br\/>Studio content offers creative freedom and professional guidance to ensure precise brand messaging. By controlling the production process, high-quality content is efficiently created.<\/p>","icon":"none","icon_width":24,"mobile_icon_width":20}}},"block_order":["question_tHmYAM","question_V9agg3"],"name":"t:sections.faq.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"","layout":"sta